# Who reviews what. GitHub requests a review from the owners of every file a pull request changes,
# and the main branch's ruleset can require their approval. The last matching pattern wins.
#
# There is one maintainer for now, so the sensitive paths below name the same owner as the rest: they
# are listed so that a second reviewer (a person or a team) is added to them, and only to them, first.

# Everything.
*                                                       @Arsslensoft

